          Where <span className="text-accent">work</span> <br /> happens.
        </h1>
        <p className="text-xl text-textSecondary max-w-xl mx-auto font-medium">
          Connect your teams, unify your systems, and drive your business forward in one place.
        </p>

        <div className="pt-8">
          <Button 
            id="nav-workspaces"
            size="lg"
            className="w-full md:w-auto text-lg px-12 h-14"
            onClick={handleGoWorkspaceListDirect}
            disabled={!state.data.cookie_consent_given}
          >
            Open Workspaces
          </Button>
